{
  "scopeName": "source.tsi.nola-keywords",
  "injectionSelector": "L:source.tsi -comment -string",
  "patterns": [
    {
      "match": "(?:\\b(export)\\s+)?\\b(infer)\\b(?=\\s+function\\b)",
      "captures": {
        "1": { "name": "keyword.control.export.ts" },
        "2": { "name": "storage.modifier.async.nola" }
      }
    },
    {
      "comment": "`ask with <alias>` — one match with captures, not three rules: a provider alias may be a JS keyword (`default`, `new` are legal config keys), and separate rules would let the TypeScript grammar claim those first. Must precede the bare `ask` rule below.",
      "match": "(?<![_$[:alnum:].])(ask)\\s+(with)\\s+([_$[:alpha:]][_$[:alnum:]]*)(?![_$[:alnum:]])",
      "captures": {
        "1": { "name": "keyword.control.flow.nola" },
        "2": { "name": "keyword.control.with.nola" },
        "3": { "name": "variable.other.enummember.nola" }
      }
    },
    { "match": "(?<![_$[:alnum:].])ask(?![_$[:alnum:]])(?!\\s*:)", "name": "keyword.control.flow.nola" },
    { "match": "\\.\\.(?=`)", "name": "keyword.operator.intent.nola" },
    {
      "begin": "(?<=`)(<)",
      "beginCaptures": {
        "1": { "name": "meta.type.parameters.ts punctuation.definition.typeparameters.begin.ts" }
      },
      "end": ">",
      "endCaptures": {
        "0": { "name": "meta.type.parameters.ts punctuation.definition.typeparameters.end.ts" }
      },
      "contentName": "meta.type.parameters.ts",
      "patterns": [{ "include": "source.ts#type" }]
    },
    {
      "comment": "`: T` glued to an extractor's closing backtick (colon-typed extractors, spec 2026-09-23) — exactly the parser's condition, so a spaced ternary colon after a template consequent (`cond ? `yes` : `no``) is left to TypeScript. The end pattern is the TypeScript grammar's own type-annotation end; nested brackets across lines are handled by source.ts#type.",
      "begin": "(?<=`)(:)(?=\\s*\\S)",
      "beginCaptures": {
        "1": { "name": "meta.type.annotation.ts keyword.operator.type.annotation.ts" }
      },
      "end": "(?<![:|&])(?!\\s*[|&]\\s+)((?=^|[,);\\}\\]]|//)|(?==[^>])|((?<=[\\}>\\]\\)]|[_$[:alpha:]])\\s*(?=\\{)))",
      "contentName": "meta.type.annotation.ts",
      "patterns": [{ "include": "source.ts#type" }]
    }
  ]
}
